            "description": "Get all facts sorted by likes count (most liked first, public)\n\n**Query Params:**\n- Reserved: `page`, `limit`, `order_by`, `order_dir`\n- Filters: `title__like`, `content__like`, `authorId__eq`, `createdAt__gte`, `createdAt__lte`\n\n**Response:** `{ results: [...], page, limit, nextPage }`"
          },
          "response": []
